  10+ 8000              ;   x86_alu_selftest: Carry clear=pass, set=fail.
  11+ 8000              ;
  12+ 8000              ; Clobbers: AF, BC, HL. Other guest state is not modified.
  13+ 8000              ; Preserves all non-arithmetic x86 FLAGS bits; bit 1 is forced to one.
  14+ 8000              ; Arithmetic flags: CF, PF, AF, ZF, SF, OF.
  15+ 8000
